OL,3,GNEWSAWhat are HMOs and why are they
OL,4,Abeing vandalised?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn recent weeks, a spate of vandalism
OL,7,Fhas seen up to 50 houses attacked in
OL,8,FSalford and neighbouring areas of
OL,9,FGreater Manchester.
OL,11,FWindows have been smashed, doors ripped
OL,12,Ffrom their hinges and walls daubed with
OL,13,Fgraffiti opposing "HMOs".
OL,15,FThe term HMO is not widely known
OL,16,Foutside housing and planning circles.
OL,17,FIt stands for "House in Multiple
OL,18,FOccupation" and refers to properties
OL,19,Fwhere three or more unrelated people
OL,20,Flive, usually with separate bedrooms
OL,21,Fbut shared facilities such as kitchens
OL,22,Fand bathrooms.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
