OL,3,GNEWSAWhat are HMOs and why are they
OL,4,Abeing vandalised?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile HMOs are often associated with
OL,7,Fstudents and young professionals, they
OL,8,Fcan also provide accommodation for
OL,9,Fpeople leaving prison, those recovering
OL,10,Ffrom drug or alcohol problems, and
OL,11,Frefugees.
